  "about": "What one mod may ask of the engine (ModValidator.cs, docs/RULES_MCP.md). Read from the base rules only: a mod can't raise its own budget. Each cap sits at or just past the biggest value the base rules or an example in mods/ already use, but for things.maxScale: a look's scale is drawn only, so it costs the core nothing, and 20 lets a giant creature through (Andrew, #61). The player stats (sim player.*, PlayerStats.cs) are the view's too, a body on its own peer: 3 times the speed is a 21 m/s sprint, still inside what streaming keeps up with, 2 times the size a wizard about 3.6 m tall, 4 times the jump about 5 m a jump, and 8 jumps before landing (Andrew asked for a quadruple jump, 2026-11-08).",
